--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Step 1: Clone or Create Project Directory

sudo mkdir -p /opt/secxng/searxng
sudo chown -R $USER:$USER /opt/secxng
cd /opt/secxng
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Step 2: Place Configuration Files
Upload or create docker-compose.yml, Caddyfile, and searxng/settings.yml inside /opt/secxng/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Step 3: Initialize, Secure Permissions, and Launch
Run the following commands in your server terminal to generate a secure 32-byte cryptographic secret key, 
set proper UID 977 container permissions, and start the stack:

sed -i "s/REPLACE_WITH_SECRET/$(openssl rand -hex 32)/g" /opt/secxng/searxng/settings.yml
sudo chown -R 977:977 /opt/secxng/searxng
docker compose down && docker compose up -d
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Step 4: Verify Container Health

docker compose ps

All four containers (secxng-core, secxng-valkey, secxng-tor, secxng-caddy) should report status Up.
